A root flow mapping lists its keys like a block mapping; a file whose root is a list (or a scalar) has no keys to list.
Expected output is hand-written: the TypeScript build has no data file support.
== args
input/flow.yaml
input/list.yaml
== file input/flow.yaml
{a: 1, b: [2, 3],
 c: {d: 4}}
== file input/list.yaml
- a: 1
- b: 2
== stdout
input/flow.yaml
[L1-L1] a: 1
[L1-L1] b
[L2-L2] c

input/list.yaml
== stderr
== exit 0
